{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your task:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d  Observe the rooms through the cameras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1Fix anomalies before they get out of hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Last the whole night: from 00:00 to 06:00.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345760/extras/4450ff1ed2ba004762a0082f23e2afad.poster.avif?t=1772391198\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345760/extras/4450ff1ed2ba004762a0082f23e2afad.webm?t=1772391198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345760/extras/4450ff1ed2ba004762a0082f23e2afad.mp4?t=1772391198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features of the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 540 unique anomalies are waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd12 23 secret endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Every change is a challenge to your attention and endurance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f Deep atmosphere of fear and tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf9 Unique mechanics: observe, analyze, act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Only the most attentive will be able to reveal all the secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345760/extras/39d2f6065cfb33d41b8be5308faceb8d.poster.avif?t=1772391198\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345760/extras/39d2f6065cfb33d41b8be5308faceb8d.webm?t=1772391198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345760/extras/39d2f6065cfb33d41b8be5308faceb8d.mp4?t=1772391198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secret Endings:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anomalies have multiple stages and will change if not dealt with immediately. They can move between rooms. If you hear a heartbeat, it means you are in danger. Watch the cameras and see the anomaly in its entirety, but act in time to avoid danger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345760/extras/7ee471009e2548b993700dc0f0b07e68.poster.avif?t=1772391198\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345760/extras/7ee471009e2548b993700dc0f0b07e68.webm?t=1772391198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345760/extras/7ee471009e2548b993700dc0f0b07e68.mp4?t=1772391198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Floor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3345760/877c85d74e023041679d92f2b902999c3bad980b.jpg"},{"name":"Second Floor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3345760/b5aef307ce65066fee348c869fd4a846a00c2d61.jpg"},{"name":"House Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3345760/b864c5e3d12b9a30062e88e3f72af24ef232a58a.jpg"},{"name":"Secret ending #1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3345760/232f5d5eb5df5380f92a97feeb59b407b57c83ec.jpg"},{"name":"Secret ending #2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/s